timestamp: 2026-08-26T12:49:00+02:00
operation: publish M1 repository SSOT branch
result: stopped before remote push

error:
  The ancestry validation returned exit status 1.

cause:
  The server-local control-main reference still pointed to the original
  Control baseline although origin/control-main had already been fast-forwarded
  with the validated R28, TLS and cron-evidence commits. The temporary bootstrap
  clone therefore used the stale local reference as its parent.

impact:
  No GitHub push or control-main update occurred during the failed operation.
  The SSOT commit existed only on the server-local bootstrap branch.

resolution:
  The server-local control-main reference was fast-forwarded to
  origin/control-main. The temporary bootstrap branch was then rebased onto that
  exact commit. A new ancestry check is required before publication.

rollback:
  Delete only the unpublished local bootstrap branch if validation fails again.
  The existing control-main and active working branch remain unchanged.
